WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.769
- AMAZING.
- SO HOT.

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:04.137
- GOT LIKE FOUR STARS SOMEWHERE.
- I HEARD IT GOT SIX STARS,

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:05.472
WHICH IS, LIKE,
IMPOSSIBLE.

00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:07.341
- OH, MY GOD.
LET'S TAKE A PICTURE.

00:00:07.341 --> 00:00:09.009
- LET'S TAKE A PICTURE RIGHT
NOW. OH, MY GOD, HERE WE GO.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:10.444
[camera snaps]
- OH, MY GOD, I'M MAKING A FACE.

00:00:10.444 --> 00:00:12.012
- OH, MY GOD, I'M, LIKE,
ONE BIG NOSE. DELETE IT.

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:14.381
- EW, DELETE IT.
- [scoffs]

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:15.515
[camera snaps]

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.017
- EW.
- WHAT AM I DOING? I'M GROSS.

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:18.285
- HOW COME I LOOK
LIKE AN ORCA WHALE?

00:00:18.285 --> 00:00:20.387
- DELETE IT.
- DELETE IT.

00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:22.890
[gun fires, screaming]
- ON THE GROUND.

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:24.424
- OH, MY GOD.
WE'RE GETTING ROBBED.

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:26.293
- OH, MY GOD, OH, MY GOD,
OH, MY GOD, OH, MY--

00:00:26.293 --> 00:00:28.161
OH, MY GOD,
WHAT'S MY EYE DOING?

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:30.163
- EW, I LOOK LIKE I'M 40.

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:31.598
DELETE IT.
- OH, MY GOD.

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:33.000
- LET'S GET OUT OF HERE,
BUT DELETE IT.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.203
- GET DOWN! DOWN!
[camera snaps]

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:38.105
- OH, MY GOD, I LOOK LIKE
SOMEBODY UNWRAPPED A MUMMY.

00:00:38.105 --> 00:00:39.840
- GOD, I LOOK LIKE
A FIVE-YEAR-OLD DREW ME.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:41.508
- TOTALLY DELETE IT.
- DELETE IT.

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:42.910
- DELETE IT.
- RIGHT?

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:45.879
- FREEZE!
[gunshots]

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.414
- EW, I TOTALLY LOOK
LIKE CLOVERFIELD.

00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:49.449
- DID I JUST HAVE
A STROKE OR SOMETHING?

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:50.717
both: DELETE IT.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:51.952
- RIGHT?
- YEAH.

00:00:51.952 --> 00:00:53.253
[gun fires]

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:55.188
- L-LADIES,
CAN YOU JUST SHOW ME

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:56.556
THE PICTURE
YOU WERE TALKING ABOUT, PLEASE?

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:58.725
- OH, IT'S LIKE--
- YEAH, STOP.

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:00.727
GREAT, RIGHT THERE.
[laughs] THAT'S GREAT.

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:02.562
G-GRADY, WE GOT A CLEAR SHOT
OF THE PERPETRATOR.

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:04.031
HE'S HOLDING A SHOTGUN
AND EVERYTHING.

00:01:04.031 --> 00:01:05.866
WAI-WAIT, WAIT,
WHERE'D THE PICTURE GO?

00:01:05.866 --> 00:01:07.167
- WE DELETED IT.
- GROSS.

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:08.669
- WHAT?
- I HAD CHILDBIRTH FACE.

00:01:08.669 --> 00:01:11.138
- YEAH, IT LOOKED LIKE
MY GRANDMOTHER HAVING AN ORGASM.

00:01:11.138 --> 00:01:13.040
- DELETE IT.
- DELETE IT.

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:16.577
- GRADY, BOOK THESE IDIOTS
FOR DESTROYING EVIDENCE.

00:01:16.577 --> 00:01:19.212
- OW.
EW.

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:20.580
WHY ARE YOU BEING
SO "MANHANDLY"?

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.049
- I CAN'T BELIEVE THIS.
WHY ARE WE EVEN--

00:01:22.049 --> 00:01:23.450
WE WERE THE HEROES
OF THE EVENING.

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:25.118
- RIDICULOUS.
- WE STOPPED THE PERPETRATOR.

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:26.486
NOW WE'RE BEING ARRESTED?
- CAN WE PLEASE--

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:28.155
OH, MY GOD,
THESE COPS SHOULD BE ARRESTED.

00:01:28.155 --> 00:01:29.556
- THIS IS A MISCARRIAGE
OF JUSTICE, THE ENTIRE TH--

00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:30.624
[both gasp]

00:01:30.624 --> 00:01:32.159
- WHAT?
NO [bleep] WAY.

00:01:32.159 --> 00:01:33.493
- OH, MY GOD, YOU CANNOT--
- DELETE IT.

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:35.028
- YOU CANNOT ARREST ME
WITH THAT PICTURE.

00:01:35.028 --> 00:01:36.330
ARE YOU KIDDING ME?
- DELETE IT.

00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:38.365
- I WAS BLINKING.
THIS IS RIDICULOUS.

00:01:38.365 --> 00:01:39.967
- DELETE IT.
- DELETE IT RIGHT NOW.

00:01:39.967 --> 00:01:41.134
DELETE IT.
YOU MUST DELETE THIS PHOTO.

00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:42.836
- DELETE IT. NO.
- DELETE IT.

00:01:42.836 --> 00:01:44.104
I'M NOT LEAVING
UNTIL HE DELETES IT.

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:45.639
- HE HAS A PICTURE OF US.
DELETE IT.

00:01:45.639 --> 00:01:47.941
- I'M NOT LEAVING UNTIL HE--
YOU GOTTA DELETE IT!

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:49.276
YOU'VE GOTTA DELETE IT.
- JUST DELETE IT.

00:01:49.276 --> 00:01:51.211
- YOU HAVE TO DELETE THIS PIC--
- DELETE IT!

